                    renewal_discount:       `Offer the deepest discount now and hope volume earns the renewal later`,
                    renewal_silent:         `Don't raise renewal — deliver this and let the relationship develop on its own`,
                    r4_conviction_label:    `Conviction: how firmly do you defend a diagnosed, measurable, feasible bid over a price-to-win? (%)`,

                    warn_rigor_range:       `Diagnostic rigour must be a percentage between 0 and 100.`,
