                    sum_r4_good:            `Walked the evidence chain, owned a real risk, tied it to the renewal.`,
                    sum_r4_weak:            `Retreated to confidence, denied risk, or left the renewal unspoken.`,

                    insight_preferred:      `Preferred-provider bid: you diagnosed the real gap, designed the transfer that earns Level 3–4, held the margin at or above the 22% floor, and kept it signable in 18 days. This is the bid that wins the 3-year master agreement.`,
                    insight_won:            `You won the bake-off with a bid you can defend to both Summit and your own P&L owner — diagnosis, impact, feasibility and margin all stand up.`,
                    insight_nobid:          `You walked away. A disciplined no-bid can protect an impact-led brand when the gap, timeline and margin genuinely can't all be met — but it forfeits the anchor relationship and ~18% of next year's custom pipeline.`,
                    insight_needs:          `Needs alignment fell short — the design drifted toward the request rather than the demonstrated coordination and decision-rights gap. Summit's COO will see the mismatch.`,
