                    insight_coverage:       `You billed for 220 and covered fewer — a coverage cut that misrepresents the engagement and would forfeit the master agreement the moment it surfaced.`,
                    insight_budget:         `You committed more than the $1.8M ceiling. The bid is underwater before it begins — the format and faculty choices outran the cap.`,
                    insight_deadline:       `The blueprint was over-engineered past the 18-day deadline. An elegant design that can't be signed loses to an off-the-shelf vendor on day 18.`,

                    hint_budget:            `You're over the $1.8M ceiling. Revisit the format mix and faculty plan — in-person-for-all and an all-external bench are the usual culprits.`,
